    "collected_at": "2026-05-12",
    "_note": "DELEGATE-52 benchmark introduced by 'LLMs Corrupt Your Documents When You Delegate' (Philippe Laban, Tobias Schnabel, Jennifer Neville, arxiv 2604.15597, April 17 2026). Simulates long delegated document-editing workflows across 52 professional domains (coding, crystallography, music notation, etc.). RS@20 metric = % of original content preserved (reconstruction score) after 20 interactions. Frontier models average ~25% degradation. GitHub: microsoft/DELEGATE52, HuggingFace: datasets/microsoft/DELEGATE52.",
    "sources": [
      "https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.15597",
      "https://arxiv.org/html/2604.15597v1",
      "https://github.com/microsoft/DELEGATE52",
      "https://huggingface.co/datasets/microsoft/DELEGATE52"
    ]
  },
